### Bilan de la Mission
* **8 pages HTML sémantiques** créées avec une inter-navigation fluide et cohérente.
* **Fichier `style.css` unique** intégrant la charte *Vice City* (néons rose/cyan, transparence de verre, ombres portées, typographie adaptée).
* **Responsive Design complet** (Desktop, Tablette, Mobile avec menu hamburger 100% CSS).
* **Intégration du logo officiel Rockstar/GTA VI** et des visuels/cartes via les liens requis.
* **Mentions « À confirmer »** intégrées dans les tableaux de codes de triche et secrets.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>GTA VI — ULTIMATE DATABASE | Vice City</title>
    <style>
        /* ==========================================
           DESIGN SYSTEM & VARIABLES (Vice City Vibes)
           ========================================== */
        :root {
            --bg-primary: #07070a;
            --bg-secondary: #0f0e17;
            --bg-card: rgba(22, 20, 35, 0.75);
            --accent-pink: #ff007f;
            --accent-purple: #7928ca;
            --accent-cyan: #00f0ff;
            --accent-orange: #ff7700;
            --text-main: #f4f4f6;
            --text-muted: #a0a0ab;
            --border-glow: rgba(255, 0, 127, 0.4);
            --font-main: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
        }

        /* ==========================================
           RESET & GLOBAL STYLES
           ========================================== */
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-primary);
            color: var(--text-main);
            font-family: var(--font-main);
            overflow-x: hidden;
            background-image: 
                radial-gradient(circle at 10% 20%, rgba(121, 40, 202, 0.15) 0%, transparent 40%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 90% 80%, rgba(255, 0, 127, 0.12) 0%, transparent 40%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.05) 0%, transparent 60%);
            background-attachment: fixed;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        /* ==========================================
           ROUTING ENGINE (Pure CSS Radio Hack)
           ========================================== */
        .nav-input {
            display: none;
        }

        .main-container {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        /* Masquage global des sections */
        .section-page {
            display: none;
            flex-grow: 1;
            padding: 30px 5% 60px 5%;
            animation: fadeIn 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) forwards;
        }

        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(10px);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        /* Activation conditionnelle des sections */
        #tab-home:checked ~ .main-container #sec-home,
        #tab-map:checked ~ .main-container #sec-map,
        #tab-cheats:checked ~ .main-container #sec-cheats,
        #tab-chars:checked ~ .main-container #sec-chars,
        #tab-vehicles:checked ~ .main-container #sec-vehicles,
        #tab-missions:checked ~ .main-container #sec-missions,
        #tab-secrets:checked ~ .main-container #sec-secrets,
        #tab-news:checked ~ .main-container #sec-news,
        #tab-guide:checked ~ .main-container #sec-guide {
            display: block;
        }

        /* ==========================================
           NAVIGATION BAR (Glassmorphism & Neon)
           ========================================== */
        header {
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 1000;
            background: rgba(7, 7, 10, 0.85);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 0, 127, 0.2);
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 15px 5%;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
        }

        .logo-area {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .logo-badge {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-pink), var(--accent-purple));
            color: #fff;
            font-weight: 900;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            padding: 6px 12px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(255, 0, 127, 0.6);
        }

        .logo-title {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #fff, var(--accent-cyan));
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }

        nav.nav-menu {
            display: flex;
            gap: 8px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        nav.nav-menu label {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            padding: 8px 14px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        nav.nav-menu label:hover {
            color: var(--text-main);
            border-color: var(--accent-cyan);
            background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.05);
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.2);
        }

        /* États Actifs de la Navigation */
        #tab-home:checked ~ header nav label[for="tab-home"],
        #tab-map:checked ~ header nav label[for="tab-map"],
        #tab-cheats:checked ~ header nav label[for="tab-cheats"],
        #tab-chars:checked ~ header nav label[for="tab-chars"],
        #tab-vehicles:checked ~ header nav label[for="tab-vehicles"],
        #tab-missions:checked ~ header nav label[for="tab-missions"],
        #tab-secrets:checked ~ header nav label[for="tab-secrets"],
        #tab-news:checked ~ header nav label[for="tab-news"],
        #tab-guide:checked ~ header nav label[for="tab-guide"] {
            color: #fff;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 0, 127, 0.3), rgba(121, 40, 202, 0.3));
            border-color: var(--accent-pink);
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(255, 0, 127, 0.4);
        }

        /* ==========================================
           UI COMPONENTS & SHARED STYLES
           ========================================== */
        h1, h2, h3 {
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 15px;
            border-left: 5px solid var(--accent-pink);
            padding-left: 15px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,0,127,0.1), transparent);
        }

        .card-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .neon-card {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 25px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .neon-card::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 3px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent-pink), var(--accent-cyan));
            opacity: 0.5;
            transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
        }

        .neon-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            border-color: var(--accent-pink);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(255, 0, 127, 0.2);
        }

        .neon-card:hover::before {
            opacity: 1;
        }

        .btn-neon {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-pink), var(--accent-purple));
            color: #fff;
            padding: 12px 25px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-decoration: none;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255, 0, 127, 0.4);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .btn-neon:hover {
